    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kunoichi Beat is a pseudo 8-bit, quasi-cinematic platformer with minor stealth elements and visual novel-style storytelling. Playing as an urban ninja, much of the platforming is parkour-influenced as players will be making use of the environment with the urban ninja\u2019s (slightly over-exaggerated) realistic jumping abilities. There are also several enemies with varying attack patterns to overcome along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several parkour-inspired, retro-styled platforming challenges with minor stealth and puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemies with their own attack patterns to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel-style storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pseudo 8-bit, pixel-art visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lofi, jazzy hip-hop soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-styled gaming experience with a dream-like, abstract vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Xbox Series, Xbox One, and Xbox 360 Controllers (recommended)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kunoichi Beat is a pseudo 8-bit, quasi-cinematic platformer with minor stealth elements and visual novel-style storytelling. Playing as an urban ninja, much of the platforming is parkour-influenced as players will be making use of the environment with the urban ninja\u2019s (slightly over-exaggerated) realistic jumping abilities. There are also several enemies with varying attack patterns to overcome along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several parkour-inspired, retro-styled platforming challenges with minor stealth and puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemies with their own attack patterns to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel-style storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pseudo 8-bit, pixel-art visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lofi, jazzy hip-hop soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-styled gaming experience with a dream-like, abstract vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Xbox Series, Xbox One, and Xbox 360 Controllers (recommended)</p></li></ul>",
